k, thin gold-rimmed glasses, a loose white round-neck short-sleeve top, light blue straight-leg jeans, and white sneakers, fair skin with red lips.\n<Subject 2> is the young woman whose identity comes entirely from <Picture 2> — long wavy black hair with loose curls and a side part, thin light-colored metal-rimmed glasses, a coral pink V-neck embroidered long dress with a fitted waist and a floor-length flared skirt, a sheer gold-embroidered shawl draped over both shoulders, and a gold necklace, fair skin with red lips.\n\nsummary:\n[video editing + reference generation] The target video is an edited version of <Video 1> in which the people in the source footage are replaced by <Subject 1> and <Subject 2>. It opens on a close view of <Subject 2>'s waist and legs and pulls back to a frontal full-body view as she steps in a staggered pattern through the damaged room, her hips swinging, one hand held near her abdomen or the front of her hips while the other arm swings out to the side, and <Subject 1> firing a gun from the opening broken through the wall at the back-left. <Subject 2> then takes turns raising an arm high, puts both hands above her head, and lets her wrists bend and drop down to her chest while her body bounces up and down and keeps stepping. The shot cuts directly from that frontal view to a low camera behind her, where she spreads her legs, lifts her arms and turns her hips toward the lens while rounds strike her hips and splash sparks. She keeps turning, sidestepping and swinging her arms, at times back to the camera and at times side-on, her hips still catching fire. At the end she faces the camera and lifts a knee into a high-knee jumping step with both arms bent and raised at her sides. The source clip's action order, camera movement, screen side, timing and room are kept, while the original faces, the original costumes and the Kotte Animation letter watermark are not kept.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2]): fully_preserved - her facial identity, long straight black hair, gold-rimmed glasses, loose white round-neck short-sleeve top and light blue jeans are retained exactly as given by the identity reference, while she fires from the wall opening exactly as in the source clip and keeps the source clip's timing.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 4], [Shot 5]): fully_preserved - her facial identity, long wavy black hair, glasses, coral pink embroidered long dress, sheer gold-embroidered shawl and gold necklace are retained exactly as given by the identity reference, and both her facing-camera beats and her rear low-angle beats stay covered by that same dress and shawl, while she performs the source clip's actions and keeps the source clip's timing.\n<Video 1>: partially_preserved - the actions, camera movement, framing, screen side, timing and room are retained, while the original performers' faces, the original costumes and the Kotte Animation letter watermark are not retained and are not reproduced.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video keeps the source clip's stylized 3D animated rendering, its warm interior lighting and its original camera language; only the people in the footage are replaced. The letter watermark reading Kotte Animation is not kept and is not reproduced anywhere in the frame. The room itself is not altered, and the wallpaper and the wall calendar on the wall stay as they are.\n[Shot 1] From 00:00.000 to 00:00.800, the shot opens on a close view of <Subject 2>'s waist and legs, the fitted waist and the flared coral pink embroidered skirt of her dress filling the lower frame, then pulls back to a frontal full-body view of her standing in the damaged room. She steps in a staggered pattern, her hips swinging from side to side, one of her own hands held near her abdomen or the front of her hips while her other arm swings out to her side, and round trails streak through the air around her. Her fair face, thin light-colored metal-rimmed glasses, long wavy black hair with loose curls, the sheer gold-embroidered shawl over both shoulders and her gold necklace are all visible. Far behind her at the back-left, <Subject 1> stands inside the opening broken through the wall in her loose white top and light blue jeans, holding and firing a gun.\n[Shot 2] From 00:00.800 to 00:01.625, still facing the camera, <Subject 2> takes turns raising an arm high, then lifts both of her hands above her head before letting her wrists bend and her hands fall down to her chest, her body bouncing up and down as her feet keep stepping in place, the embroidered skirt and the gold shawl shifting with every bounce. <Subject 1> stays in the wall opening behind her, still firing from there.\n[Shot 3] At 00:01.625, the shot cuts directly from the frontal view to a low camera angle positioned behind <Subject 2>; there is no turn through a side view before she faces away. She is seen from the back and below with her legs spread apart, her arms lifted and her hips pushed toward the lens, the embroidered back of her pink dress, the gold-bordered shawl across her shoulders and her long wavy black hair filling the rear view, while rounds hit her hips and splash sparks. <Subject 1> is now out of frame in this low rear angle.\n[Shot 4] From 00:02.100 to 00:03.300, still in the low rear angle, <Subject 2> keeps turning, sidestepping and swinging her arms, so that she is at times back to the camera and at times side-on to it, the gold-embroidered hem of her long skirt and her hips sweeping across the foreground while rounds continue to land on her hips and throw orange sparks.\n[Shot 5] From 00:03.300 to 00:03.750, she turns to face the camera and lifts one knee into a high-knee jumping step, both of her arms bent and raised at her sides, her fair face, glasses, long wavy black curls, the sheer gold shawl and the coral pink embroidered dress all visible as she hops on the spot.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nQuiet indoor room tone under a steady stream of rounds passing close by and striking her hips and the pink fabric, ricochet sparks hissing off, gunshots coming from the wall opening, and quick scuffs of her shoes on the debris-strewn floor.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "编辑文本"}, "name": "编辑文本", "label": "编辑文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "编辑文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "MuyeTextEditOutput", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [916.1142578125, 528.8655395507812], "pos": [-2482.00048828125, 5577.1259765625], "id": 218, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"编辑文本": true}, "Node name for S&R": "MuyeTextEditOutput"}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [314], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "frame_count", "label": "帧计数", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "frame_count"}, {"name": "audio", "links": [315], "label": "音频", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"name": "video_info", "links": [311], "label": "视频信息", "type": "VHS_VIDEOINFO", "localized_name": "video_info"}], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": {"custom_height": 0, "force_rate": 24, "custom_width": 0, "select_every_nth": 1, "frame_load_cap": 360, "videopreview": {"paused": false, "hidden": false, "params": {"custom_height": 0, "filename": "5dac08f4f1d2b47ba42d534d52a9e968692fbd2f9905af15b075f6ddaa022001.mp4", "force_rate": 24, "custom_width": 0, "select_every_nth": 1, "frame_load_cap": 360, "format": "video/mp4", "skip_first_frames": 0, "type": "input"}, "muted": true}, "format": "AnimateDiff", "video": "5dac08f4f1d2b47ba42d534d52a9e968692fbd2f9905af15b075f6ddaa022001.mp4", "skip_first_frames": 0, "force_size": "Disabled", "choose video to upload": "image"}, "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "meta_batch", "label": "批次管理", "type": "VHS_BatchManager", "localized_name": "meta_batch"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "vae", "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_n